{
  "about": "A Klartext program: every path function moves, so its kind comes from the function (L straight, C CR CT CP CTP arcs, LP polar line); FMAX makes a rapid; CC, TOOL CALL and CYCL DEF write no move. A continued block marks its first line only, and an incremental axis word counts as a move. FMAX written apart as F MAX is a rapid too, for its own block only.",
